flowchart LR
 A[Provider charge succeeded] --> B[Payment DB: success + outbox]
 B -.->|Relay; retries may duplicate| C[Kafka PaymentSucceeded]
 C -.-> D[Inventory inbox + SOLD + outbox]
 D -.-> E[Kafka ReservationCommitted]
 E -.-> F[Order unavailable30 seconds]
 F -->|Restart and replay| G[Inbox + unique order + OrderConfirmed]
 G --> H[Customer sees confirmed]
 A -->|Local response lost| R[Reconciler looks up SAME provider intent]
 R --> B
